      },
      "implementationBoundary": "本人認証/鍵/同意/lease/Brokerは別契約。hardware/IdP/独立Securityは別gate。",
      "requiredSupplement": "CORE01をAUTHunit化。RP/origin/challenge/cookie/CSRF/rate/並行credential/失効/fresh実UI。",
